### 4. Login com senha incorreta (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "errada"
}

### 5. Login (guarda o token)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "carlos@logistica.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 6. Rota protegida sem token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/motoristas

### 7. Motorista com CPF inválido (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/motorista
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Teste",
    "cnh": "111",
    "cpf": "123",
    "telefone": "48900000000"
}

