### 21. Cadastrar Entrega 1
POST http://localhost:3000/entrega
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "cidadeDestino": "Florianópolis",
    "status": "TRANSITO",
    "data": "2026-11-10",
    "hora": "14:00:00",
    "idCarga": 1
}

