### 24. Atualizar status da Entrega 2 para ENTREGUE
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ENTREGUE"
}

### 25. Status inválido (400)
PUT http://localhost:3000/entrega/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "PERDIDO"
}

### 26. Listar Entregas por data crescente (05/11, 10/11, 15/11)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=ASC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 27. Listar Entregas por data decrescente (15/11, 10/11, 05/11)
GET http://localhost:3000/entregas?ordem=DESC
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 28. Deletar Motorista 3
DELETE http://localhost:3000/motorista/3
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}
